Rush and Attack. Thank you, Sean, for stating the obvious.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.260
I have to read it as they're written down.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.460
It is not and, though. There's no and in there, right?

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.120
Well, it's like Rush and Attack.

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.220
Rush and Attack. All right, all right.

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:36.240
Sorry. It's like Rush apostrophe N.

